Linus,

please pull sound (ASoC) fixes for v2.6.38-rc7 from:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/tiwai/sound-2.6.git fix/asoc

These commits should have been included in the previous pull requests,
but slipped just mistakenly.  The changes aren't so small for the late
rc, but they are mostly hw specific and have been long enough in the
tree.


Thanks!

Takashi

===

Dimitris Papastamos (2):
      ASoC: WM8994: Improve robustness in some use cases
      ASoC: WM8994: Improve playback robustness

Janusz Krzysztofik (1):
      ASoC: CX20442: fix wrong reg_cache_default content

Mark Brown (2):
      ASoC: Sync initial widget state with hardware
      ASoC: Ensure supplies are maintained for force enabled widgets

Stephen Warren (2):
      ASoC: WM8903: Fix mic detection register definitions
      ASoC: WM8903: Fix mic detection enable logic

